  <h1>Learn</h1>
  <p>
    The reference tells you what a command takes. This section tells you what the database is doing
    and why, which is the part that decides whether you reach for the right command in the first
    place.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/docs/learn/introduction">Introduction to StrataDB</a> is the long-form answer to what Strata
