    commits and versions, time travel, and what it means for a database to be a directory.
  </p>
  <p>
    <b>Working with data</b> takes the five data models one at a time. They live in the same database,
    under the same history, and
    <a href="/docs/learn/working-with-data">the tour</a> is the place to start if you are not sure which
    one you want.
  </p>
